d=CRT001391269&citationBean.artiId=ART003159641\" class=\"cretLink\"  target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"  style=\"color: #0355a3\">\r\n\t\t김승균\r\n\t\t/Seungkeun Kim\r\n\t\r\n\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6163-622X\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n\t\t<i class=\"fab fa-orcid\" style=\"color:#a0c736\"></i>\r\n\t\t<span class=\"blind\">orcid 바로가기</span>\r\n\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<sup class=\"num\">5</sup>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t,&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<a href=\"/kciportal/po/citationindex/poCretDetail.kci?citationBean.cretId=CRT000294084&citationBean.artiId=ART003159641\" class=\"cretLink\"  target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"  style=\"color: #0355a3\">\r\n\t\t석진영\r\n\t\t/Jinyoung Suk\r\n\t\r\n\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6886-9808\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n\t\t<i class=\"fab fa-orcid\" style=\"color:#a0c736\"></i>\r\n\t\t<span class=\"blind\">orcid 바로가기</span>\r\n\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<sup class=\"num\">6</sup>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<!-- 소속 -->\r\n\t\t<div class=\"attach\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t<sup class=\"num\">1</sup>충남대학교\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t<sup class=\"num\">2</sup>충남대학교\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t<sup class=\"num\">3</sup>충남대학교\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t<sup class=\"num\">4</sup>충남대학교\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t<sup class=\"num\">5</sup>충남대학교\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t<sup class=\"num\">6</sup>충남대학교\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</article>\r\n\t\t<!-- bottom area -->\r\n\t\t<div class=\"articleBody\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<!-- 초록 -->\r\n\t\t<div class=\"box\">\r\n\t\t<h2>\r\n\t\t초록\r\n\t\t<a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" class=\"arrow-btn\"><i class=\"fas fa-caret-up open\"></i><span class=\"blind\">열기/닫기 버튼</span></a>\r\n\t\t</h2>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"innerBox open\" style=\"display:block;\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<p id=\"korAbst\" style=\"white-space: pre-line; letter-spacing: .2pt\">.</p><br/>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<p id=\"engAbst\" style=\"white-space: pre-line; letter-spacing: .2pt\">Urban air mobility (UAM) requires precise take-off and landing maneuvers in urban environments. This study proposes an algorithm that uses a convolutional neural network to recognize an H-shaped unknown landing marker as a landing target and issue it as a precision guidance command in a fixed 3D body coordinate system. The UAM can make precise landings through this approach, even on existing landing pads without any landing guide facility. The algorithm was developed and verified through a software-in-the-loop simulation. It was then implemented and modularized on a companion computer to be applied to all flight control computers operating on MAVROS. In addition, the modular precision landing system was mounted on the UAM scaled model and verified through a flight test. Consequently, precision landing performance was verified in both simulation and flight tests.</p><br/>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<!-- 키워드 -->\r\n\t\t<div class=\"box\">\r\n\t\t<h2>키워드<a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" class=\"arrow-btn\"><i class=\"fas fa-caret-up open\"></i><span class=\"blind\">열기/닫기 버튼</span></a></h2>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"innerBox open\" style=\"display:block;\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"overbox ib\">\r\n\t\t<a href=\"javascript:;\" style=\"color: #0355a3\" id=\"keywd\">.</a>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"ovbox\">\r\n\t\t<a href=\"javascript:fncKeywordSearch(2,'.')\" class=\"ico_graph_line\">이 키워드로 연구동향 분석</a>\r\n\t\t<a href=\"javascript:fncKeywordSearch(1,'.')\" class=\"ico_search\">이 키워드로 논문 검색</a>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<p>urban air mobility, convolutional neural network, image recognition, modular precision landing system, SITL (Software In The Loop simulation), flight test</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"report-detail-right\">\r\n\t\t<h4>피인용 횟수</h4>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"numbox\">\r\n\t\t<ul class=\"nopm\">\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<strong>KCI</strong>\r\n\t\t<span class=\"right-count\">\r\n\t\t0회\r\n\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<li class=\"box\">\r\n\t\t<strong>FWCI</strong>\r\n\t\t<span class=\"right-count\">\r\n\t\t<small>(2025-08-04 기준)</small>\r\n\t\t0\r\n\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t<a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" class=\"arrow-btn\" onclick=\"javascript:updownToggle_right(this);\"><i class=\"fas fa-caret-down\"></i><span class=\"blind\">열기/닫기 버튼</span></a>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"updowntxt\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n\t\t같은 출판연도, 주제분야, 논문 형태에 따라 인용을 측정하여 정규화한 인용지수입니다. \r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"linkbox\">\r\n\t\t<ul class=\"nopm\">\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<a href=\"javascript:;\" style=\"cursor: text;\">\r\n\t\t<em><i class=\"far fa-eye\"></i></em><span class=\"colorRed\">\r\n\t\t139\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t회 열람 \r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t                            \r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<!-- 20230511 정재영선생님 요청으로 원문id에서 pdfFileid로 파라미터 변경 -->\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<li class=\"green\">\r\n\t\t<!-- 잘못된 논문아이디가 연결되는경우가 발생하여 파라미터에서 넘어온 논문아이다로 대체 2021.12.01 -->\r\n\r\n\t\t<a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"fncArtiPreView('ART003159641');\">\r\n\t\t<em>\r\n\t\t<i class=\"far fa-file-pdf\"></i>\r\n\t\t</em>\r\n\t\t<span>\r\n\t\tKCI 원문 미리보기\r\n\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t<i class=\"fa fa-question-circle\" title=\"원문 전체보기와 다운로드는 학술단체가 KCI에서 공개 동의한 논문만 가능합니다.\"></i>\r\n\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<li>\r\n\t\t<a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"$('#dialog-modal').show(); fncSearchArtiKistiOrte()\">\r\n\t\t<em><i class=\"far fa-file-search\"></i></em><span>원문 찾아보