UAM Scaled Model Using a CNN-based Modular Precision Landing System<br />T2 - Journal of Institute of Control, Robotics and Systems<br />JO - Journal of Institute of Control, Robotics and Systems<br />PY - 2025<br />VL - 31<br />IS - 1<br />PB - Institute of Control, Robotics and Systems<br />SP - 20<br />EP - 28<br />SN - 1976-5622<br />AB - Urban air mobility (UAM) requires precise take-off and landing maneuvers in urban environments. This study proposes an algorithm that uses a convolutional neural network to recognize an H-shaped unknown landing marker as a landing target and issue it as a precision guidance command in a fixed 3D body coordinate system. The UAM can make precise landings through this approach, even on existing landing pads without any landing guide facility. The algorithm was developed and verified through a software-in-the-loop simulation. It was then implemented and modularized on a companion computer to be applied to all flight control computers operating on MAVROS. In addition, the modular precision landing system was mounted on the UAM scaled model and verified through a flight test. Consequently, precision landing performance was verified in both simulation and flight tests.<br />KW - urban air mobility, convolutional neural network, image recognition, modular precision landing system, SITL (Software In The Loop simulation), flight test<br />DO - <br />UR - <br />ER - \r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"order2\" class=\"page current\" >\r\n\t\t<p id=\"APA\">\r\n\t\tSeonghyeon Park, Yechan Yang, Young Seo, Hoijo Jeong, Seungkeun Kim and Jinyoung Suk. (2025). Simulation and Flight Test of a UAM Scaled Model Using a CNN-based Modular Precision Landing System. Journal of Institute of Control, Robotics and Systems, 31(1), 20-28.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"order3\" class=\"page \" >\r\n\t\t<p id=\"Harvard\">\r\n\t\tSeonghyeon Park, Yechan Yang, Young Seo, Hoijo Jeong, Seungkeun Kim and Jinyoung Suk. 2025, \"Simulation and Flight Test of a UAM Scaled Model Using a CNN-based Modular Precision Landing System\", Journal of Institute of Control, Robotics and Systems, vol.31, no.1 pp.20-28. \r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"order4\" class=\"page \" >\r\n\t\t<p id=\"MLA\">\r\n\t\tSeonghyeon Park, Yechan Yang, Young Seo, Hoijo Jeong, Seungkeun Kim, Jinyoung Suk \"Simulation and Flight Test of a UAM Scaled Model Using a CNN-based Modular Precision Landing System\" Journal of Institute of Control, Robotics and Systems 31.1 pp.20-28 (2025) : 20.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"order5\" class=\"page \" >\r\n\t\t<p id=\"Vancouver\">\r\n\t\tSeonghyeon Park, Yechan Yang, Young Seo, Hoijo Jeong, Seungkeun Kim, Jinyoung Suk. Simulation and Flight Test of a UAM Scaled Model Using a CNN-based Modular Precision Landing System.  2025; 31(1): 20-28. \r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"order6\" class=\"page \" >\r\n\t\t<p id=\"Chicago\">\r\n\t\tSeonghyeon Park, Yechan Yang, Young Seo, Hoijo Jeong, Seungkeun Kim and Jinyoung Suk. \"Simulation and Flight Test of a UAM Scaled Model Using a CNN-based Modular Precision Landing System\" Journal of Institute of Control, Robotics and Systems 31, no.1 (2025) : 20-28.\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"order7\" class=\"page \" >\r\n\t\t<p id=\"ACS\">\r\n\t\tSeonghyeon Park; Yechan Yang; Young Seo; Hoijo Jeong; Seungkeun Kim; Jinyoung Suk. Simulation and Flight Test of a UAM Scaled Model Using a CNN-based Modular Precision Landing System. Journal of Institute of Control, Robotics and Systems, 31(1), 20-28. \r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"order8\" class=\"page \" >\r\n\t\t<p id=\"AMA\">\r\n\t\tSeonghyeon Park; Yechan Yang; Young Seo; Hoijo Jeong; Seungkeun Kim; Jinyoung Suk. Simulation and Flight Test of a UAM Scaled Model Using a CNN-based Modular Precis